{"id":"6a487bf2bfd4f11f","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-prikry-extension.md","title":"ZFC Prikry Extension","display":"df-zfc-prikry-extension — ZFC Prikry Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prikry-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prikry-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-prikry-extension — ZFC Prikry Extension","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-prikry-condition]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prikry-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prikry-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prikry-extension — ZFC Prikry Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d73e3b0726a3b895\" href=\"?note=d73e3b0726a3b895\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prikry-condition\">58-df-zfc-prikry-condition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90335d0f6a9bc60f\" href=\"?note=90335d0f6a9bc60f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference\">58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q,s,t,A,B,U,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(p,q,s,t,A,B,U,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S\\)</span> (Prikry-condition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d73e3b0726a3b895\" href=\"?note=d73e3b0726a3b895\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prikry-condition\">58-df-zfc-prikry-condition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrikryExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrikryExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrikryExtension}_S(q,p,U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\exists s,t,A,B\\;(\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(p,s,A,U,\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(q,t,B,U,\\kappa)\\land s\\subseteq t\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\subseteq A\\land B\\subseteq A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrikryExtension}_S(q,p,U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\exists s,t,A,B\\;(\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(p,s,A,U,\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(q,t,B,U,\\kappa)\\land s\\subseteq t\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\subseteq A\\land B\\subseteq A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The stronger condition end-extends the old stem using only points from the old measure-one set, and shrinks that set.</li>\n<li>For finite-sequence graphs, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\subseteq t\">\\(s\\subseteq t\\)</span> is the end-extension relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prikry-condition","status":"resolved","id":"d73e3b0726a3b895","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prikry-condition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference","status":"resolved","id":"90335d0f6a9bc60f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prikry-condition","status":"resolved","id":"d73e3b0726a3b895","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S$ (Prikry-condition predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-prikry-condition]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"p,q,s,t,A,B,U,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrikryExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrikryExtension}_S(q,p,U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\exists s,t,A,B\\;(\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(p,s,A,U,\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(q,t,B,U,\\kappa)\\land s\\subseteq t\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\subseteq A\\land B\\subseteq A)","display":true},{"tex":"s\\subseteq t","display":false}],"bytes":1191,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-prikry-extension.md|58-df-zfc-prikry-extension]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d73e3b0726a3b895","36d7463d215be751","90335d0f6a9bc60f"]}